    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a caterpillar. Your quest? Stay that way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wriggle your way through the treetops, maneuver up mushrooms, and leap across lilypads as you search for a way to stop your transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/03dce84fd580f32b41ca073fcbff7db3.avif?t=1743845504\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Climb over any surface with the freedom of being a cute squishy bug.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Weave your way through the hanging vines of an enchanted forest lost to time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Help out the curious critters of the forest you meet along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be small! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.poster.avif?t=1743845504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.webm?t=1743845504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.mp4?t=1743845504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promotional cover art by the talented Drew Shields.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a caterpillar. Your quest? Stay that way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wriggle your way through the treetops, maneuver up mushrooms, and leap across lilypads as you search for a way to stop your transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/03dce84fd580f32b41ca073fcbff7db3.avif?t=1743845504\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Climb over any surface with the freedom of being a cute squishy bug.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Weave your way through the hanging vines of an enchanted forest lost to time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Help out the curious critters of the forest you meet along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be small! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.poster.avif?t=1743845504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.webm?t=1743845504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104610/extras/e238043c70a0c1bb041c9e3baf515872.mp4?t=1743845504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promotional cover art by the talented Drew Shields.</p>",
